<p><strong>AWS is responsible for Security 'of' the Cloud</strong></p>

<p>AWS is responsible for protecting the infrastructure that runs all of th=
e services offered in the AWS Cloud. This infrastructure is composed of the=
 hardware, software, networking, and facilities that run AWS Cloud services=
.</p>

<p><strong>For abstracted services like Amazon S3, AWS operates the infrast=
ructure layer, the operating system, and platforms</strong></p>

